         B.Call to repentance in light of the locust invasion (1:13–20)

            II.      Warning of judgment future: the enemy invasion brings the day of the Lord (2:1–17)
         A.      Description of the enemy invasion (2:1–11)
         B.      Call to repentance in light of the enemy invasion (2:12–17)

            III.      Deliverance and restoration for Judah on the day of the Lord (2:18–27)

            IV.      Outpouring of the Spirit and signs in the heavens on the day of the Lord (2:28–32)

            V.      Judgment on the nations and blessing for Judah on the day of the Lord');
